en. Run tests with `pnpm test`.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":1227,"output":401,"cacheRead":40454,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":42082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907069446,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-37758593-c091-4731-b8fc-6b333116547c","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01LpjgXCx3ZA5R5LWyqux2qU","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 7 tests still green.\n\n## Refactoring Report\n\n**Naming Evaluation (First Priority):**\n- `runScenario`, `quotePremium`, `componentsBasePremium`, `basePremiumFor`, `isComponent` all clearly reveal intent. **No renames needed.**\n\n**Refactoring Applied (Rule 4 — Fewest Elements + Rule 3 — No Duplication):**\n\nRemoved the dead `rune: 25` entry from `BASE_PREMIUMS`.\n\n**Reasoning:**\n- `rune` is a component type (in `COMPONENT_TYPES`). In `quotePremium`, components are filtered *out* of `mainItems`, so `basePremiumFor` is **never** invoked with `rune`. The entry was dead knowledge.\n- It also conceptually duplicated `COMPONENT_PREMIUM = 25`. Runes are now priced solely through the component pricing path (`componentsBasePremium`), giving that knowledge a single representation.\n\n**APP Mass Change:**\n- Before: `BASE_PREMIUMS` = 5 constants + 5 key bindings = 10\n- After: 4 constants + 4 key bindings = 8\n- **Mass: 10 → 8 (delta −2)** for the affected declaration.\n\n**Tests:** All 7 passing (34 todo).\n\nNote: I evaluated the known-future concern that `componentsBasePremium` groups ALL components together regardless of type (per the Green-phase note). The upcoming todo tests (`2 runes + 1 moonstone`, `3 runes + 3 moonstones`) will require per-type grouping — but that is *new behavior* not yet demanded by any passing test. Introducing per-type grouping now would be speculative (violating \"only add complexity when it serves a clear purpose\"), so I deliberately left it for the test that drives it.\n\nRefactoring Complete:\n**Refactoring**: Removed dead/duplicated `rune: 25` from `BASE_PREMIUMS`\n**Mass Change**: 10 → 8 (−2)\n**Tests**: All passing"}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-5/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 7\nRecent Green phase: Added component pricing — components (rune/moonstone) at 25 G each, blocks of 3 alike at 60 G. Note current componentsBasePremium groups ALL components together regardless of type (per-type grouping not yet required by tests).\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green. Run tests with `pnpm test`.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 7\nRecent Green phase: Added component pricing — components (rune/moonstone) at 25 G each, blocks of 3 alike at 60 G. Note current componentsBasePremium groups ALL components together regardless of type (per-type grouping not yet required by tests).\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green. Run tests with `pnpm test`.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784907076219},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll start by reading the current implementation and test files to understand the code."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_015pi9tZVMtN43sG49MPvsiP","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01SyWoLbZpempAXXL3ikkq5u","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.spec.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":247,"output":128,"cacheRead":9696,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":10071,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907076240,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-31da3da0-bdca-4ee7-80e7-f6f22aef795c","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_015pi9tZVMtN43sG49MPvsiP","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"const PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\nconst FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE = 0.1;\n\ninterface Item {\n  type: string;\n}\n\ninterface QuoteStep {\n  op: \"quote\";\n  items: Item[];\n}\n\ninterface Scenario {\n  customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: number };\n  steps: QuoteStep[];\n}\n\ninterface QuoteResult {\n  premium: number;\n}\n\nconst BASE_PREMIUMS: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 100,\n  amulet: 60,\n  staff: 80,\n  potion: 40,\n  rune: 25,\n};\n\nconst COMPONENT_TYPES = new Set([\"rune\", \"moonstone\"]);\nconst COMPONENT_PREMIUM = 25;\nconst BLOCK_SIZE = 3;\nconst BLOCK_PREMIUM = 60;\n\nconst isComponent = (item: Item): boolean => COMPONENT_TYPES.has(item.type);\n\nconst componentsBasePremium = (components: Item[]): number => {\n  const blocks = Math.floor(components.length / BLOCK_SIZE);\n  const remainder = components.length % BLOCK_SIZE;\n  return blocks * BLOCK_PREMIUM + remainder * COMPONENT_PREMIUM;\n};\n\nconst basePremiumFor = (item: Item): number => BASE_PREMIUMS[item.type];\n\nconst quotePremium = (items: Item[]): number => {\n  const mainItems = items.filter((item) => !isComponent(item));\n  const components = items.filter(isComponent);\n  const basePremium =\n    mainItems.reduce((sum, item) => sum + basePremiumFor(item), 0) +\n    componentsBasePremium(components);\n  const firstInsuranceSurcharge = basePremium * FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE;\n  return Math.ceil(basePremium + firstInsuranceSurcharge + PROCESSING_FEE);\n};\n\nexport const runScenario = (scenario: Scenario): { results: QuoteResult[] } => {\n  const results = scenario.steps.map((step) => ({ premium: quotePremium(step.items) }));\n  return { results };\n};\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784907078364},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01SyWoLbZpempAXXL3ikkq5u","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\nimport { runScenario } from \"./claim-office.js\";\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - quote base premiums\", () => {\n  // Edge case: empty item list\n  it(\"empty item list -> premium 5 G (only processing fee)\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 5 });\n  });\n\n  // Base premiums per item type (base + 5 G fee, newcomer 0 years => +10% first insurance)\n  it(\"single sword newcomer -> 100 base +10 first +5 fee = 115 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\" }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 115 });\n  });\n  it(\"single amulet newcomer -> 60 base +6 first +5 fee = 71 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"amulet\" }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 71 });\n  });\n  it(\"single staff newcomer -> 80 base +8 first +5 fee = 93 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"staff\" }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 93 });\n  });\n  it(\"single potion newcomer -> 40 base +4 first +5 fee = 49 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"potion\" }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 49 });\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - component building blocks\", () => {\n  it(\"2 runes -> 50 G base premium\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }] }] });\n    // base 50 + 10% first (5) + 5 fee = 60\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 60 });\n  });\n  it(\"3 runes -> 60 G base premium (block applies)\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }] }] });\n    // block base 60 + 10% first (6) + 5 fee = 71\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 71 });\n  });\n  it.todo(\"4 runes -> 100 G base premium (no block, requires exactly 3)\");\n  it.todo(\"7 runes -> 175 G base premium\");\n  it.todo(\"2 runes + 1 moonstone -> 75 G base premium (no block: different types)\");\n  it.todo(\"3 runes + 3 moonstones -> 120 G base premium (two separate blocks)\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - premium modifiers\", () => {\n  it.todo(\"cursed sword newcomer -> 165 G (100 +50 curse +10 first +5 fee)\");\n  it.todo(\"high-enchantment sword ench 5 newcomer -> 100 +30 +10 +5 = 145 G\");\n  it.todo(\"sword ench 4 not cursed newcomer -> no high-ench surcharge = 115 G\");\n  it.todo(\"cursed high-enchantment sword ench 5 -> both surcharges apply\");\n  it.todo(\"long-standing customer (2 years) -> loyalty discount applies\");\n  it.todo(\"first insurance surcharge 10% applies per item in a quote\");\n  it.todo(\"follow-up contract 15% discount on each contract after first\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - modifier scope on multi-item policies\", () => {\n  it.todo(\"cursed sword + plain amulet -> curse surcharge on cursed item only -> 210 G before fee\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - rounding\", () => {\n  it.todo(\"premium yielding 197.5 G -> 198 G (rounded up, MHPCO favor)\");\n  it.todo(\"payout yielding 350.5 G -> 350 G (rounded down, MHPCO favor)\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - claim processing basics\", (