rchargeFor`.\n- Introduced two intent-revealing predicates: `isCursed` and `isHighEnchantment`.\n- Renamed `curseSurchargeFor` → `surchargeFor` (generic, now takes a predicate + rate). The call sites (`surchargeFor(mainItems, isCursed, CURSE_RATE)` and `surchargeFor(mainItems, isHighEnchantment, HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_RATE)`) read declaratively and reveal intent clearly.\n\n**Step 3 — Rule 3 (No Duplication)**: The `filter(...).reduce((sum, item) => sum + basePremiumFor(item) * rate, 0)` structure was conceptually duplicated between the cursed and high-enchantment surcharges. Both represent the same knowledge: *\"sum a percentage of base premium over main items matching a condition.\"* Now expressed once.\n\n**APP Mass**:\n- Before (both surcharge computations): ≈ 53 (two independent filter/reduce chains + inline conditional, ~23 + ~30).\n- After: single `surchargeFor` helper (≈ 20: filter+reduce loops 10, invocations ~8, bindings ~4, rate binding) + two tiny predicate helpers (≈ 6 each = 12) + two 2-invocation call sites (≈ 8).\n- **Combined ≈ 40**. Mass Change: **53 → 40 (delta −13)**.\n\n**Rule 2 vs APP**: The extraction lowers mass *and* improves clarity — predicate names make the tax rules self-documenting, and the shared helper eliminates copy-paste drift risk. No clarity was sacrificed.\n\n**Refactoring**: Extracted parameterized `surchargeFor` helper + `isCursed`/`isHighEnchantment` predicates; removed inline duplication.\n**Mass Change**: 53 → 40 (−13)\n**Tests**: All 13 passing."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":948,"output":780,"cacheRead":15525,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":17253,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784907364746,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-744810ca-0c0d-4d48-81e6-1d2959f7b2b8","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"}],"stderr":"","usage":{"input":17551,"output":2589,"cacheRead":54595,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"contextTokens":17253,"turns":5},"model":"requesty/vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","stopReason":"stop"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1784907375071},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01JBZaDCiFpvp2hJFYNLDVYP","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-5/src/claim-office.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":1955,"output":118,"cacheRead":53405,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":55478,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907375074,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-549f7347-5070-48ea-a469-a410ef32bdcd","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01JBZaDCiFpvp2hJFYNLDVYP","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"const PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\nconst FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE = 0.1;\nconst CURSE_RATE = 0.5;\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_RATE = 0.3;\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD = 5;\n\ninterface Item {\n  type: string;\n  material?: string;\n  enchantment?: number;\n  cursed?: boolean;\n}\n\ninterface QuoteStep {\n  op: \"quote\";\n  items: Item[];\n}\n\ninterface Scenario {\n  customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: number };\n  steps: QuoteStep[];\n}\n\ninterface QuoteResult {\n  premium: number;\n}\n\nconst BASE_PREMIUMS: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 100,\n  amulet: 60,\n  staff: 80,\n  potion: 40,\n};\n\nconst COMPONENT_TYPES = new Set([\"rune\", \"moonstone\"]);\nconst COMPONENT_PREMIUM = 25;\nconst BLOCK_SIZE = 3;\nconst BLOCK_PREMIUM = 60;\n\nconst isComponent = (item: Item): boolean => COMPONENT_TYPES.has(item.type);\n\nconst componentGroupPremium = (count: number): number =>\n  count === BLOCK_SIZE ? BLOCK_PREMIUM : count * COMPONENT_PREMIUM;\n\nconst componentsBasePremium = (components: Item[]): number => {\n  const countsByType = new Map<string, number>();\n  for (const component of components) {\n    countsByType.set(component.type, (countsByType.get(component.type) ?? 0) + 1);\n  }\n  let total = 0;\n  for (const count of countsByType.values()) {\n    total += componentGroupPremium(count);\n  }\n  return total;\n};\n\nconst basePremiumFor = (item: Item): number => BASE_PREMIUMS[item.type];\n\nconst surchargeFor = (\n  mainItems: Item[],\n  qualifies: (item: Item) => boolean,\n  rate: number,\n): number =>\n  mainItems\n    .filter(qualifies)\n    .reduce((sum, item) => sum + basePremiumFor(item) * rate, 0);\n\nconst isCursed = (item: Item): boolean => item.cursed === true;\n\nconst isHighEnchantment = (item: Item): boolean =>\n  (item.enchantment ?? 0) >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD;\n\nconst quotePremium = (items: Item[]): number => {\n  const mainItems = items.filter((item) => !isComponent(item));\n  const components = items.filter(isComponent);\n  const basePremium =\n    mainItems.reduce((sum, item) => sum + basePremiumFor(item), 0) +\n    componentsBasePremium(components);\n  const curseSurcharge = surchargeFor(mainItems, isCursed, CURSE_RATE);\n  const highEnchantmentSurcharge = surchargeFor(\n    mainItems,\n    isHighEnchantment,\n    HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_RATE,\n  );\n  const firstInsuranceSurcharge = basePremium * FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE;\n  return Math.ceil(\n    basePremium + curseSurcharge + highEnchantmentSurcharge + firstInsuranceSurcharge + PROCESSING_FEE,\n  );\n};\n\nexport const runScenario = (scenario: Scenario): { results: QuoteResult[] } => {\n  const results = scenario.steps.map((step) => ({ premium: quotePremium(step.items) }));\n  return { results };\n};\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784907378316},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clean. \n\n## Red -- Test 14: sword ench 4 not cursed newcomer -> 115 G (no high-ench surcharge)"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01NLZWrYa6ideYzsST7WuDJa","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"  it(\"sword ench 4 not cursed new