"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907424509,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-fc30f039-b4ee-43a7-902d-bfd3d3a431d2","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01Frxz4AGh68YZ1p4iQS5Ab7","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 16 tests remain green.\n\n### Step 5: Post-refactor Mass\n\nThe `quotePremium` body now reads a uniform sequence of named computations (`curseSurcharge`, `highEnchantmentSurcharge`, `firstInsuranceSurcharge`, `loyaltyDiscount`) — the conditional logic is encapsulated behind an intent-revealing name. Local mass in `quotePremium` for the loyalty line dropped from ~14 (binding + conditional + 2 invocations) to ~5 (binding + 1 invocation + 2 args), with the conditional relocated (not eliminated) into the small helper. Net conceptual mass is roughly flat; the win is Rule 2 clarity and symmetry.\n\n### Step 6: Decision\n\n**Refactoring Applied**:\n- **Naming (Rule 2)**: Extracted `loyaltyDiscountFor(basePremium, yearsWithMHPCO)`, giving the loyalty discount the same named-helper treatment as `surchargeFor`-derived surcharges.\n- **Benefit**: `quotePremium` now reads as a uniform list of named premium components rather than mixing an inline ternary among named values. Restores structural symmetry between surcharges and discounts.\n- **Rule 1**: All tests stay green.\n- **Rule 3/4**: No duplication introduced; element count essentially unchanged (one small pure helper added, one inline expression removed).\n\nOther candidates (`surchargeFor` generalization, component grouping) were already well-factored and needed no change.\n\n## Refactoring Complete\n- **Refactoring**: Extracted `loyaltyDiscountFor` helper for clearer, symmetric intent\n- **Mass Change**: local loyalty logic ~14 → ~5 in `quotePremium` (conditional relocated to named helper); net roughly flat, clarity improved\n- **Tests**: 16 passing, all green"}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-5/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 16\nRecent Green phase: quotePremium now takes yearsWithMHPCO and subtracts a 20% loyalty discount on base premium when years >= 2. runScenario passes scenario.customer.yearsWithMHPCO.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green. Run tests with `pnpm test`.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 16\nRecent Green phase: quotePremium now takes yearsWithMHPCO and subtracts a 20% loyalty discount on base premium when years >= 2. runScenario passes scenario.customer.yearsWithMHPCO.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green. Run tests with `pnpm test`.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784907430180},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm examining the implementation and test files to understand how everything works together.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01HYDyZzUQVFUrWz8wcAVVku","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01FKjS2aHPoLEw6LU2cezC53","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.spec.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":238,"output":122,"cacheRead":9696,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":10056,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907430200,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-d18a27be-1625-47ba-bfc1-2fe5042077e9","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01HYDyZzUQVFUrWz8wcAVVku","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"const PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\nconst FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE = 0.1;\nconst CURSE_RATE = 0.5;\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_RATE = 0.3;\nconst HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD = 5;\nconst LOYALTY_RATE = 0.2;\nconst LOYALTY_THRESHOLD_YEARS = 2;\n\ninterface Item {\n  type: string;\n  material?: string;\n  enchantment?: number;\n  cursed?: boolean;\n}\n\ninterface QuoteStep {\n  op: \"quote\";\n  items: Item[];\n}\n\ninterface Scenario {\n  customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: number };\n  steps: QuoteStep[];\n}\n\ninterface QuoteResult {\n  premium: number;\n}\n\nconst BASE_PREMIUMS: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 100,\n  amulet: 60,\n  staff: 80,\n  potion: 40,\n};\n\nconst COMPONENT_TYPES = new Set([\"rune\", \"moonstone\"]);\nconst COMPONENT_PREMIUM = 25;\nconst BLOCK_SIZE = 3;\nconst BLOCK_PREMIUM = 60;\n\nconst isComponent = (item: Item): boolean => COMPONENT_TYPES.has(item.type);\n\nconst componentGroupPremium = (count: number): number =>\n  count === BLOCK_SIZE ? BLOCK_PREMIUM : count * COMPONENT_PREMIUM;\n\nconst componentsBasePremium = (components: Item[]): number => {\n  const countsByType = new Map<string, number>();\n  for (const component of components) {\n    countsByType.set(component.type, (countsByType.get(component.type) ?? 0) + 1);\n  }\n  let total = 0;\n  for (const count of countsByType.values()) {\n    total += componentGroupPremium(count);\n  }\n  return total;\n};\n\nconst basePremiumFor = (item: Item): number => BASE_PREMIUMS[item.type];\n\nconst surchargeFor = (\n  mainItems: Item[],\n  qualifies: (item: Item) => boolean,\n  rate: number,\n): number =>\n  mainItems\n    .filter(qualifies)\n    .reduce((sum, item) => sum + basePremiumFor(item) * rate, 0);\n\nconst isCursed = (item: Item): boolean => item.cursed === true;\n\nconst isHighEnchantment = (item: Item): boolean =>\n  (item.enchantment ?? 0) >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD;\n\nconst quotePremium = (items: Item[], yearsWithMHPCO: number): number => {\n  const mainItems = items.filter((item) => !isComponent(item));\n  const components = items.filter(isComponent);\n  const basePremium =\n    mainItems.reduce((sum, item) => sum + basePremiumFor(item), 0) +\n    componentsBasePremium(components);\n  const curseSurcharge = surchargeFor(mainItems, isCursed, CURSE_RATE);\n  const highEnchantmentSurcharge = surchargeFor(\n    mainItems,\n    isHighEnchantment,\n    HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_RATE,\n  );\n  const firstInsuranceSurcharge = basePremium * FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE;\n  const loyaltyDiscount =\n    yearsWithMHPCO >= LOYALTY_THRESHOLD_YEARS ? basePremium * LOYALTY_RATE : 0;\n  return Math.ceil(\n    basePremium +\n      curseSurcharge +\n      highEnchantmentSurcharge +\n      firstInsuranceSurcharge -\n      loyaltyDiscount +\n      PROCESSING_FEE,\n  );\n};\n\nexport const runScenario = (scenario: Scenario): { results: QuoteResult[] } => {\n  const results = scenario.steps.map((step) => ({\n    premium: quotePremium(step.items, scenario.customer.yearsWithMHPCO),\n  }));\n  return { results };\n};\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784907432199},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01FKjS2aHPoLEw6LU2cezC53","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\nimport { runScenario } from \"./claim-office.js\";\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - quote base premiums\", () => {\n  // Edge case: empty item list\n  it(\"empty item list -> premium 5 G (only processing fee)\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 5 });\n  });\n\n  // Base premiums per item type (base + 5 G fee, newcomer 0 years => +10% first insurance)\n  it(\"single sword newcomer -> 100 base +10 first +5 fee = 115 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\" }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 115 });\n  });\n  it(\"single amulet newcomer -> 60 base +6 first +5 fee = 71 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"amulet\" }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 71 });\n  });\n  it(\"single staff newcomer -> 80 base +8 first +5 fee = 93 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"staff\" }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 93 });\n  });\n  it(\"single potion newcomer -> 40 base +4 first +5 fee = 49 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"potion\" }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 49 });\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - component building blocks\", () => {\n  it(\"2 runes -> 50 G base premium\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }] }] });\n    // base 50 + 10% first (5) + 5 fee = 60\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 60 });\n  });\n  it(\"3 runes -> 60 G base premium (block applies)\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }] }] });\n    // block base 60 + 10% first (6) + 5 fee = 71\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 71 });\n  });\n  it(\"4 runes -> 100 G base premium (no block, requires exactly 3)\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }] }] });\n    // base 100 + 10 first + 5 fee = 115\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 115 });\n  });\n  it(\"7 runes -> 175 G base premium\", () => {\n    const items = Array.from({ length: 7 }, () => ({ type: \"rune\" }));\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items }] });\n    // base 175 + 17.5 first + 5 fee = 197.5 -> 198\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 198 });\n  });\n  it(\"2 runes + 1 moonstone -> 75 G base premium (no block: different types)\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"moonstone\" }] }] });\n    // base 75 + 7.5 first + 5 fee = 87.5 -> 88\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 88 });\n  });\n  it(\"3 runes + 3 moonstones -> 120 G base premium (two separate blocks)\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [\n      { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" },\n      { type: \"moonstone\" }, { type: \"moonstone\" }, { type: \"moonstone\" },\n    ] }] });\n    // base 120 + 12 first + 5 fee = 137\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 137 });\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - premium modifiers\", () => {\n  it(\"cursed sword newcomer -> 165 G (100 +50 curse +10 first +5 fee)\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 3, cursed: true }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 165 });\n  });\n  it(\"high-enchantment sword ench 5 newcomer -> 100 +30 +10 +5 = 145 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 5, cursed: false }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 145 });\n  });\n  it(\"sword ench 4 not cursed newcomer -> no high-ench surcharge = 115 G\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 4, cursed: false }] }] });\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 115 });\n  });\n  it(\"cursed high-enchantment sword ench 5 -> both surcharges apply\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 5, cursed: true }] }] });\n    // 100 + 50 curse + 30 high-ench + 10 first + 5 fee = 195\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 195 });\n  });\n  it(\"long-standing customer (2 years) -> loyalty discount applies\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 2 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 3, cursed: false }] }] });\n    // 100 base - 20 loyalty + 10 first + 5 fee = 95\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 95 });\n  });\n  it.todo(\"first insurance surcharge 10% applies per item in a quote\");\n  it.todo(\"follow-up contract 15% discount on each contract after first\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - modifier scope on multi-item policies\", () => {\n  it.todo(\"cursed sword + plain amulet -> curse surcharge on cursed item only -> 210 G before fee\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - rounding\", () => {\n  it.todo(\"premium yielding 197.5 G -> 198 G (rounded up, MHPCO favor)\");\n  it.todo(\"payout yielding 350.5 G -> 350 G (rounded down, MHPCO favor)\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - claim processing basics\", () => {\n  it.todo(\"regular sword steel ench 3 damage 500 -> payout 400 (500 - 100 deductible)\");\n  it.todo(\"damage to a rune (value 250) damage 200 -> payout 100 (200 - 100)\");\n  it.todo(\"high-enchantment ench 8 sword damage 1000 -> payout 400 (50% then deductible)\");\n  it.todo(\"dragon-material sword ench 8 damage 1000 -> payout 400 (high-ench wins, then deductible)\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - enchantment threshold vs dragon material\", () => {\n  i