w-up ≈ 6 across assignments\n\nThe two discount concepts now share **one** `percentageWhen` helper instead of a bespoke helper + inline ternary. Duplication of the conditional-percentage pattern is eliminated.\n\n### Step 6: Decision\n\n**Refactoring Applied**:\n- **Rule 3 (No Duplication)**: Both discounts (loyalty, follow-up) expressed \"apply a percentage of base when a condition holds\" — one as a helper, one inline. Extracted the shared `percentageWhen(base, rate, applies)` helper so both use a single representation.\n- **Rule 2 (Reveals Intent)**: Introduced `isLoyalCustomer(years)` predicate, making the loyalty condition self-documenting at the call site and consistent with the boolean `isFollowUp` flag.\n- **Tests**: 18/18 still green.\n\nThe surcharge side (`surchargeFor`) already uses a shared higher-order helper, so no further duplication remained there.\n\n### Step 7: Report\n\n**Refactoring Complete**\n- **Refactoring**: Unified loyalty and follow-up discounts under a shared `percentageWhen` helper; added `isLoyalCustomer` predicate for clarity.\n- **Mass Change**: discount concept ~25 → ~24, with duplication of the conditional-percentage pattern eliminated (single representation).\n- **Tests**: All 18 passing."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":889,"output":685,"cacheRead":16847,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":18421,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784907544404,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-b20dad04-3ced-4a21-99c2-326bd86ad787","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"}],"stderr":"","usage":{"input":21358,"output":2953,"cacheRead":55870,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"contextTokens":18421,"turns":5},"model":"requesty/vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","stopReason":"stop"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1784907553875},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01BFYABXX8LiTcMvcWEqbwjm","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_15-24-24_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-5/src/claim-office.ts","offset":60,"limit":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":2727,"output":162,"cacheRead":64314,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":67203,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784907553878,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-aa1148dc-5e80-4bab-aba2-dddbbb4afa77","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01BFYABXX8LiTcMvcWEqbwjm","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"const basePremiumFor = (item: Item): number => BASE_PREMIUMS[item.type];\n\nconst surchargeFor = (\n  mainItems: Item[],\n  qualifies: (item: Item) => boolean,\n  rate: number,\n): number =>\n  mainItems\n    .filter(qualifies)\n    .reduce((sum, item) => sum + basePremiumFor(item) * rate, 0);\n\nconst isCursed = (item: Item): boolean => item.cursed === true;\n\nconst isHighEnchantment = (item: Item): boolean =>\n  (item.enchantment ?? 0) >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_THRESHOLD;\n\nconst percentageWhen = (base: number, rate: number, applies: boolean): number =>\n  applies ? base * rate : 0;\n\nconst isLoyalCustomer = (yearsWithMHPCO: number): boolean =>\n  yearsWithMHPCO >= LOYALTY_THRESHOLD_YEARS;\n\nconst quotePremium = (items: Item[], yearsWithMHPCO: number, isFollowUp: boolean): number => {\n  const mainItems = items.filter((item) => !isComponent(item));\n  const components = items.filter(isComponent);\n  const basePremium =\n    mainItems.reduce((sum, item) => sum + basePremiumFor(item), 0) +\n    componentsBasePremium(components);\n  const curseSurcharge = surchargeFor(mainItems, isCursed, CURSE_RATE);\n  const highEnchantmentSurcharge = surchargeFor(\n    mainItems,\n    isHighEnchantment,\n    HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_RATE,\n  );\n  const firstInsuranceSurcharge = basePremium * FIRST_INSURANCE_RATE;\n  const loyaltyDiscount = percentageWhen(basePremium, LOYALTY_RATE, isLoyalCustomer(yearsWithMHPCO));\n  const followUpDiscount = percentageWhen(basePremium, FOLLOW_UP_RATE, isFollowUp);\n  return Math.ceil(\n    basePremium +\n      curseSurcharge +\n      highEnchantmentSurcharge +\n      firstInsuranceSurcharge -\n      loyaltyDiscount -\n      followUpDiscount +\n      PROCESSING_FEE,\n  );\n};\n\nexport const runScenario = (scenario: Scenario): { results: QuoteResult[] } => {\n  let quoteCount = 0;\n  const results = scenario.steps.map((step) => {\n    const isFollowUp = quoteCount > 0;\n    quoteCount += 1;\n    return {\n      premium: quotePremium(step.items, scenario.customer.yearsWithMHPCO, isFollowUp),\n    };\n  });\n  return { results };\n};\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784907557667},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Red -- Test 19: cursed sword + plain amulet -> 210 G before fee\n\nCurse surcharge applies to cursed item only (50% of cursed sword's base 100 = 50). Policy base 160. 160 + 50 = 210 before further modifiers and fee. Newcomer: 210 + first insurance (10% of base 160 = 16) + 5 fee = 231.\n\nLet me verify: base 160, curse 50, first 16, fee 5 = 231."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01J9kT8mFs5uN1PB2wwR3bKv","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"  it(\"cursed sword + plain amulet -> curse surcharge on cursed item only -> 210 G before fee\", () => {\n    const out = runScenario({ customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [\n      { type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 3, cursed: true },\n      { type: \"amulet\", material: \"silver\", enchantment: 2, cursed: false },\n    ] }] });\n    // base 160 + 50 curse (on sword only) = 210 before modifiers; + 16 first + 5 fee = 231\n    expect(out.results[0]).toEqual({ premium: 231 });\n  });","oldText":"  it.todo(\"cursed sword + plain amulet -> curse surcharge on cursed item only -> 210 G before fee\");"}],"